/search?tbm=nws&amp;q=%22Transportation+in+Taiwan%22+-wikipedia&amp;tbs=ar:1" class="external text">news</a> <b>·</b> <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.google.com/search?&amp;q=%22Transportation+in+Taiwan%22&amp;tbs=bkt:s&amp;tbm=bks" class="external text">newspapers</a> <b>·</b> <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.google.com/search?tbs=bks:1&amp;q=%22Transportation+in+Taiwan%22+-wikipedia" class="external text">books</a> <b>·</b> <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22Transportation+in+Taiwan%22" class="external text">scholar</a> <b>·</b> <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jstor.org/action/doBasicSearch?Query=%22Transportation+in+Taiwan%22&amp;acc=on&amp;wc=on" class="external text">JSTOR</a></span></small></span>  <span class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">May 2013</span>)</i></span><span class="hide-when-compact"><i> (<small><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Maintenance_template_removal" title="Help:Maintenance template removal">Learn how and when to remove this message</a></small>)</i></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt91"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_needing_additional_references_from_May_2013"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_articles_needing_additional_references"/></span>
<p id="mwAVM">As of 2013, Taiwan maintains the following pipelines<sup about="#mwt95" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-20" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-20"}}'><a href="#cite_note-20" id="mwAVQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAVU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAVY">[</span>20<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAVc">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<ul id="mwAVg"><li id="mwAVk">Condensate 25<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAVo"> </span>km</li>
<li id="mwAVs">Gas 802<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAVw"> </span>km</li>
<li id="mwAV0">Oil 241<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAV4"> </span>km</li></ul>

